    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "text": "Clarissa"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Sophie Okonedo shines in Arie and Chuko Esiri’s (Eyimofe, LFF 2020) sophomore feature film, a delicate, sun-soaked re-imagining of Mrs Dalloway, set in contemporary Lagos."
    },
    {
